### GET all students
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### POST bad data (Validation Test)
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "age": -5
}

### Add a new course  <-- THIS SEPARATOR IS MISSING!
POST http://localhost:8080/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mathematics"
}

### Enroll Student 1 in Course 1
POST http://localhost:8080/students/1/courses/1

### Search for Ali
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search?name=Ali
### Search for a course
GET http://localhost:8080/courses/search?title=Mathematics
### Search students by age
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search/age?age=20

### Delete Courses
DELETE http://localhost:8080/courses/1
